  "content_id": "16136208",
  "title": "Thorchain RUNE Network Fees",
  "description": "Thorchain (RUNE) Network – Cross-Chain Swaps Made Simple\nThorchain allows users to swap assets across blockchains without centralized exch...",
  "body": "<h1 id=\"h_01JSZ68F843ZZZZHXVN56225RK\">Thorchain (RUNE) Network – Cross-Chain Swaps Made Simple</h1><p class=\"no-margin\">Thorchain allows users to swap assets across blockchains without centralized exchanges, with fees based on swap complexity and traffic.</p><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ68F8403BPRANKE1FR9FEY\">How RUNE Fees Work</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Transaction size and network congestion</b>.</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Swaps involve two transactions (inbound + outbound), each paid separately in <b>RUNE</b> or the swapped asset.</p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\">Edge estimates and displays the required fees clearly before you confirm.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ68F84KP2MQZH2679GPN45\">Fee Options Available</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Swap fees calculated dynamically</b> — no manual adjustment needed.</p></li></ul><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ68F8404DKRP40HAYMBJBC\">Average Cost</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Varies depending on the swap, but generally <b>$0.50 to $3.00 USD</b> total per swap pair (both sides).</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ68F843RX5VY51F357WPD0\">Why It Matters</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Thorchain unlocks true decentralized trading across chains. Edge makes sure your swap fees are fully transparent and optimized without needing to dive into complicated settings.</p>",
